  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: configuration file injection via carriage returns in\n     multi-line ConfigParser values (CVE-2026-0864)\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-0864.patch: normalize CR and CRLF to LF plus tab\n       continuation at both value-serialisation sites in\n       RawConfigParser.write() in Lib/ConfigParser.py, so a carriage return\n       inside an attacker-controlled value can no longer inject extra keys and\n       sections into the written file; adds the upstream regression test to\n       Lib/test/test_cfgparser.py.\n     - CVE-2026-0864",
